{"4068600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Go Amazing!", "steam_appid": 4068600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like pixelated mazes and a certain degree of struggle, this game is for you! You control Blue, a confused little thing caught in an ever changing series of mazes while avoiding dangerous traps and troublesome, wandering enemies called <i>[checks notes]</i> &quot;Red Guys.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Really? That's the best we could come up with?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all of your patience and focus to complete 25 levels of randomly generated mazes with all of the difficulty of your most dreaded 8-bit classic games and music so repetitive that even the developer’s dog had to walk out while playtesting it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Don’t worry. You can turn the music off. We're proud of our work but we won’t judge if you do.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for an easier time, this game features a Maze Only mode that takes enemies and traps out of the equation! Not the warps, though. We like to think of warps as part of the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safe passage through any level is never guaranteed. Can you withstand the journey through all 25 levels in a single, 12-life run through randomness?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like pixelated mazes and a certain degree of struggle, this game is for you! You control Blue, a confused little thing caught in an ever changing series of mazes while avoiding dangerous traps and troublesome, wandering enemies called <i>[checks notes]</i> &quot;Red Guys.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Really? That's the best we could come up with?)</p><p 